  "prefLabel": "Env-A 2806.07 Recordkeeping and Reporting",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 2806.07 Recordkeeping and Reporting.\n\n(a) The owner or operator of a non-metallic mineral processing plant shall retain records for a minimum of 5 years on:\n\n(1) The total quantity of all materials processed on an annual basis; and\n\n(2) The results of all performance testing conducted to determine compliance with the standards specified in Env-A 2803, including 40 CFR 60, subpart OOO.\n\n(b) The owner or operator of a non-metallic mineral processing plant shall submit to the department the results of any performance test conducted to determine compliance with the standards set forth in Env-A 2803, including 40 CFR 60, subpart OOO, within 60 days of the test.\n\nSource. #9793, eff 10-1-10; ss by #12693, eff 12-22-18\n\nAppendix: State Statute(s) and Federal Regulations Implemented",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a2800.html"
